					"content": "谢谢…啊，糟了，专注练习，忘了本来要做的事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100906,
					"content": "呜…可我已经累得动不了了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100907,
					"content": "荣誉骑士，能不能帮我带个口信给杰克？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100908,
						101100913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100908,
					"content": "杰克是谁？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100909
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101100909,
					"content": "杰克是我的朋友，一位新人冒险家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100910,
					"content": "原本我们约好，今晚一起讨论冒险计划…能麻烦你转告他改天见吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100911,
					"content": "我想，他今天应该是在<color=#00E1FFFF>「南风之狮的庙宇」</color>冒险吧，跟斯坦利先生一起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100912,
					"content": "那是一位名震蒙德、曾经抵达「烬寂海」的传说级大冒险家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
				{
					"id": 101100917,
					"content": "很久没去那里了，我也想再去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101100918
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101100918,
					"content": "啊，那真是太谢谢你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "艾琳"
				},
